wasivst Wine-under-blink spike runs on CI: .github/workflows/wine-under-blink-spike.yml (triggered on push to the spike files or workflow_dispatch). It builds Alpine 3.19+Wine64 rootfs via apk-in-container, runs tools/spikes/wine-under-blink.mjs under webix, publishes verdict + unsupported-syscall gap map to the GH step summary + artifact wine-under-blink-spike. First run: 26641633364 on branch rethink/webix-architecture (2026-05-29). Check gh run view for the VERDICT line: wine ran / did NOT run under blink, plus the gap map that feeds webix-syscall-coverage-map.